  unitName: Dark Fire Rineth
  unitId: 10684
  unitNumber: 1039
  description: Wielder of the Sacred Crystal. Long ago when humans had no means to
    defend themselves against demons, Rineth prayed to the gods for strength. She
    then gained an enormous amount of power, using it to defeat countless enemies.
    However, though she had sought this power to protect her beloved family and friends,
    the people never praised her as a hero. Instead, they came to fear the god-like
    powers she wielded, and thus her name went down in history as a demonic figure.
  summonDesc: I'm no heroine...<br>But I want to help everyone...<br>So I'll help
    you out...
  fusionDesc: Look at my precious crystals...<br>They get brighter and brighter...<br>How
    lovely...
